# oracle: fix press/langevin flips the box: the yz keyword's piston (driven by Pxy, moving xy) with a target of -60 on an LJ liquid whose xy tilt starts at 2.9 (0.58 of the x length), plus x and y pistons; xy passes 0.6 of the x length and the box flips on a neighbor rebuild step
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured with native LAMMPS: engine vs native thermo 1.0e-12, atoms 2.6e-12; xy goes from 3.01 at step 90 to -2.00 at step 100 in both.
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box prism 0 3 0 3 0 3 0.0 0.0 0.0
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
change_box      all xy final 2.9 remap units box
mass            1 1.0
velocity        all create 1.0 87287 loop all
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all press/langevin x 0.5 0.5 1.0 y 0.5 0.5 1.0 yz -60.0 -60.0 0.2 temp 1.0 1.0 4321 flip yes
thermo_style    custom step temp pe press pxy lx ly lz xy xz yz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             160
